"use a rather unusual compatible noise frequency layout.\n"
"removes some noise frequencies on PC Engine."
msgstr ""
"använder en ganska ovanlig kompatibel ljudfrekvenslayout.\n"
"tar bort vissa brusfrekvenser på PC Engine."

